==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Poliwhirl|89}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Poliwhirl}}.
*'''Knuckle Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Geodude|44}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

